{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51299","headline":"泛太湖 · 薛据","name":"泛太湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万顷波涵一碧秋，飘飘随处任轻舟。\n踏歌听立忘机鹭，击楫惊飞熟梦鸥。\n烟水淡图山点翠，云霞丽景日抛球。\n帆收不尽湖天景，何必蒹葭古渡头。\n（《古今图书集成·山川典》二八二《太湖部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛据","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51299.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51299","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}